message: "If you use Tally or its design in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Tally: pocket money that can't be talked into the wrong purchase"
abstract: >-
  A family-funded, purpose-bound allowance on Monad. It (or the holder's AI assistant)
  may pay only for an item a merchant signed, at the signed price, to the registered
  merchant, inside the family's rules; a Monad contract enforces the cheapest match.
type: software
